WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:19.066
Wonder which one.

2
00:00:20.433 --> 00:00:22.600
Hm. There we are...

3
00:00:22.666 --> 00:00:24.600
Our catch of the day.

4
00:00:24.666 --> 00:00:26.900
Looks like it's catchin' 40 winks.

5
00:00:26.966 --> 00:00:30.600
With luck, it will keep catching them.

6
00:00:30.666 --> 00:00:32.333
Finders, keepers!

7
00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.333
Operation Take Tyrunt rocks!

8
00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.133
- First, become its best friend.
- Then make it evolve.

9
00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:44.833
Into a towering Tyrantrum!

10
00:00:44.900 --> 00:00:47.433
It's a dream! And it's coming true!

11
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:50.633
- The perfect addition to our crew!
- Runt?

12
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:52.900
Tyrunt. Top of the morning to you.

13
00:00:52.966 --> 00:00:55.833
You see, we're your trainers, starting right now.

14
00:00:55.900 --> 00:00:57.100
Welcome aboard.

15
00:00:59.700 --> 00:01:03.366
No fair! You charbroiled my hair! This is no time for revolt!

16
00:01:03.433 --> 00:01:05.066
You're rocking the boat!

17
00:01:05.133 --> 00:01:06.766
Don't be a Pokémon dolt!

18
00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:10.033
- I'm getting air sick.
- I'm getting sick of you.

19
00:01:10.100 --> 00:01:11.933
Get you foot off from under my shoe.

20
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:15.033
- The fickle finger of fate!
- Tyrunt overboard!

21
00:01:28.566 --> 00:01:30.366
Water... Found it.

22
00:01:34.933 --> 00:01:36.766
Huh?

23
00:01:36.833 --> 00:01:38.033
I'm so thirsty.

24
00:01:46.700 --> 00:01:48.933
-Huh?

25
00:01:50.466 --> 00:01:53.233
Ah. Oh, no!

26
00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.666
Hang on! I'll help you!

27
00:01:55.733 --> 00:01:59.066
Tyrunt!

28
00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:05.066
- Ty?
- See? You're OK now.

29
00:02:05.133 --> 00:02:07.900
Tyrunt!

30
00:02:07.966 --> 00:02:09.766
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

31
00:02:09.833 --> 00:02:11.533
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

32
00:02:11.600 --> 00:02:14.966
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

33
00:02:15.033 --> 00:02:16.433
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

34
00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:20.266
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

35
00:02:20.333 --> 00:02:23.533
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

36
00:02:23.600 --> 00:02:26.966
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

37
00:02:27.033 --> 00:02:30.933
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

38
00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:35.633
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

39
00:02:35.700 --> 00:02:37.900
♪ Pokémon! ♪

40
00:02:42.266 --> 00:02:44.500
The Tiny Caretaker!

41
00:02:50.400 --> 00:02:52.700
Clemont, Clemont?

42
00:02:52.766 --> 00:02:56.233
Hey, Clemont!

43
00:02:56.300 --> 00:02:58.133
All right, what's up?

44
00:02:58.200 --> 00:03:00.600
- Ty!
- Ah!

45
00:03:02.833 --> 00:03:05.500
- Huh? Clemont, what's wrong?
- Pika.

46
00:03:05.566 --> 00:03:07.900
-Pikachu! Pi!

47
00:03:11.200 --> 00:03:15.133
- You found it in the river?
- Yeah, it was stuck.

48
00:03:15.200 --> 00:03:17.333
Wait, isn't that...

49
00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:20.466
Tyrunt. The Royal Heir Pokémon.

50
00:03:20.533 --> 00:03:23.700
When unhappy, Tyrunt will go on an angry rampage.

51
00:03:23.766 --> 00:03:27.633
- It evolves into Tyrantrum.
- I wonder if it's wild.

52
00:03:27.700 --> 00:03:29.200
That would be really rare.

53
00:03:29.266 --> 00:03:32.933
- Tyrunt!
- Ah! Tyrunt!

54
00:03:33.000 --> 00:03:35.366
Heh. You're wearing Tyrantrum pyjamas,

55
00:03:35.433 --> 00:03:37.433
so it's probably curious about you.

56
00:03:37.500 --> 00:03:40.333
Huh. This? Like 'em?

57
00:03:40.400 --> 00:03:43.266
-Heh. Aww. Sweet.

58
00:03:43.333 --> 00:03:46.700
- Tyrunt!
- Ah! Hey!

59
00:03:46.766 --> 00:03:47.900
Hm! You can't do that!

60
00:03:50.033 --> 00:03:51.966
Ty...

61
00:03:52.033 --> 00:03:53.933
Don't do it again, 'kay?

62
00:03:56.433 --> 00:03:59.966
Look, Tyrunt. Please don't cry.

63
00:04:00.100 --> 00:04:03.066
- Look! Peek-a-boo...
- Huh?

64
00:04:03.133 --> 00:04:05.600
-Huh?

65
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.933
-Is everything better now?

66
00:04:13.233 --> 00:04:15.166
Oof!

67
00:04:15.233 --> 00:04:16.233
Pika!

68
00:04:16.300 --> 00:04:18.766
-You should be more careful!

69
00:04:18.833 --> 00:04:22.766
Uh-oh. You're super dirty. I'll be right back!

70
00:04:22.833 --> 00:04:25.233
Time for a brushing!

71
00:04:28.300 --> 00:04:32.666
- You're all clean now.
- Tyrunt. Ty.

72
00:04:32.733 --> 00:04:33.900
Feel good? I'm glad.

73
00:04:33.966 --> 00:04:36.766
I'd say Tyrunt's really taken a shine to Bonnie.

74
00:04:36.833 --> 00:04:38.133
Yeah.

75
00:04:39.233 --> 00:04:41.133
-Huh?

76
00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:44.233
Hungry? Yeah, me too. So let's eat!

77
00:04:44.300 --> 00:04:45.866
Pika!

78
00:04:48.733 --> 00:04:49.866
- Ah...
- Ah!

79
00:04:52.733 --> 00:04:54.766
Is it yummy?

80
00:04:56.233 --> 00:04:59.233
I think Tyrunt likes Pokémon food.

81
00:04:59.300 --> 00:05:02.200
- Is it good, Tyrunt?
- Tyrunt!

82
00:05:02.266 --> 00:05:04.433
Slow down! Don't bite the bowl!

83
00:05:08.066 --> 00:05:11.766
Now, keep your mouth open. Brushing your teeth's good for you.

84
00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:13.400
- That Tyrunt is so cute.
- Pika.

85
00:05:13.466 --> 00:05:16.766
A wild Tyrunt that likes to get its teeth brushed?

86
00:05:16.833 --> 00:05:18.766
Wow.

87
00:05:18.833 --> 00:05:23.633
Now it's clean-up time... 'Kay, hold still.

88
00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.633
That's a lot of Tyrunt to clean up.

89
00:05:26.700 --> 00:05:29.633
Just like a parent would. So cute!

90
00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:32.700
Parent? I'm just being a trainer. Right?

91
00:05:32.766 --> 00:05:35.633
-Tyrunt.

92
00:05:37.900 --> 00:05:39.766
- Pika! Pika!
- Denne!

93
00:05:41.200 --> 00:05:44.400
- Pika, pika!
- Ty!

94
00:05:44.466 --> 00:05:46.600
Pika, pika!

95
00:05:46.666 --> 00:05:50.633
Bunn!

96
00:05:50.700 --> 00:05:52.866
- Denne-ne!
- Heh. It's so fast!

97
00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:57.866
- Ty!
- That's not yours! Don't bite it!

98
00:05:57.933 --> 00:05:59.166
Ty?

99
00:05:59.233 --> 00:06:02.733
You really shouldn't bite everything. It's a bad habit.

100
00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:05.733
- Tyrunt.
- Thanks.

101
00:06:07.933 --> 00:06:09.466
By!

102
00:06:09.533 --> 00:06:11.666
'Kay! Here I come!

103
00:06:11.733 --> 00:06:13.666
- Pika, pika!
- Oh!

104
00:06:13.733 --> 00:06:16.166
- Denne-ne!
- Huh? Ah!

105
00:06:16.233 --> 00:06:18.200
Hm...

106
00:06:20.066 --> 00:06:22.000
- Found you, Pikachu!
- Pika!

107
00:06:22.066 --> 00:06:23.700
Found you, Dedenne!

108
00:06:23.766 --> 00:06:25.733
Found you, Bunnelby!

109
00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.533
- Yay! I found all of you!
- Pika.

110
00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.233
-Pika?

111
00:06:29.300 --> 00:06:32.400
- Ah! I found you, too!
- Rar!

112
00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:40.733
- Tyrunt sure loves Bonnie's attention.
- It sure does.

113
00:06:40.800 --> 00:06:44.066
-Huh?

114
00:06:44.133 --> 00:06:45.933
- Ty!
- Aaah!

115
00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:47.700
- Runt!
- It's not time yet.

116
00:06:47.766 --> 00:06:50.166
We'll do this when you get bigger.

117
00:06:50.233 --> 00:06:53.166
- Here, it's a Poké Puff.
- Ty.

118
00:06:53.233 --> 00:06:56.766
Say thanks like this. Thanks for the food!

119
00:07:02.100 --> 00:07:03.466
Runt!

120
00:07:03.533 --> 00:07:06.466
Wow! I'm so glad you like it!

121
00:07:06.533 --> 00:07:10.766
Yippee!

122
00:07:10.833 --> 00:07:13.133
So, would you like to stay with me forever?

123
00:07:13.200 --> 00:07:16.133
- Want me to keep you?
- Runt?

124
00:07:16.200 --> 00:07:19.400
Then let's do that. We'll travel together!

125
00:07:21.933 --> 00:07:25.200
Ah. What happened?

126
00:07:25.266 --> 00:07:27.333
- Uh! Are you OK?
- Bunn.

127
00:07:28.100 --> 00:07:29.933
Huh?

128
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:32.433
Bonnie! What's going on?

129
00:07:35.566 --> 00:07:37.700
Preparing for trouble is what's going on!

130
00:07:37.766 --> 00:07:40.266
And making it double from dusk to dawn!

131
00:07:40.333 --> 00:07:42.800
To protect the world from devastation!

132
00:07:42.866 --> 00:07:45.366
To unite all people within our nation!

133
00:07:45.433 --> 00:07:48.366
To denounce the evils of truth and love!

134
00:07:48.433 --> 00:07:51.933
To net us some Pokémon from high up above!

135
00:07:52.000 --> 00:07:53.700
- Jessie!
- And James.

136
00:07:53.766 --> 00:07:56.966
Team Rocket blasts off at the speed of light!

137
00:07:57.033 --> 00:08:00.333
Surrender now or prepare for a precarious fight!

138
00:08:00.400 --> 00:08:01.933
Meowth, that's right!

139
00:08:03.933 --> 00:08:05.133
- Team Rocket!
- Pika.

140
00:08:05.200 --> 00:08:07.633
- Help us, please!
- Bunnelby.

141
00:08:07.700 --> 00:08:10.833
- Let them go, now!
- That would just be silly.

142
00:08:10.900 --> 00:08:13.366
This Tyrunt has been with us since day one.

143
00:08:13.433 --> 00:08:16.766
- The others are icing on the cake.
- Team Rocket's truly on the take.

144
00:08:16.833 --> 00:08:19.233
- So give us a break.
- But you'll get none.

145
00:08:19.300 --> 00:08:21.466
-Pika!

146
00:08:21.533 --> 00:08:23.466
Our work is done.

147
00:08:23.533 --> 00:08:24.900
-Pika.

148
00:08:24.966 --> 00:08:26.066
Huh?

149
00:08:27.300 --> 00:08:29.966
- They're gone!
- Bonnie, no!

150
00:08:30.033 --> 00:08:32.500
Who's that Pokémon?

151
00:08:37.299 --> 00:08:39.799
It's Tyrantrum!

152
00:08:39.866 --> 00:08:42.200
Tyrantrum!

153
00:08:44.266 --> 00:08:48.100
I said no! You're not gonna get Tyrunt, never ever!

154
00:08:48.166 --> 00:08:51.066
Oh, please. Notice you're in a net.

155
00:08:51.133 --> 00:08:53.700
And that severely limits your options.

156
00:08:53.766 --> 00:08:55.933
I'm keeping Tyrunt, see?

157
00:08:56.000 --> 00:08:59.600
We're best friends and there's nothing you guys can do about it!

158
00:08:59.666 --> 00:09:02.633
Stop! You have already been informed Tyrunt's ours!

159
00:09:02.700 --> 00:09:05.966
Runt, Tyrunt!

160
00:09:06.033 --> 00:09:07.800
Thanks, Tyrunt. Yay!

161
00:09:07.866 --> 00:09:09.633
All right, Gourgeist.

162
00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.233
- Go!
- Inkay, let it flow!

163
00:09:11.300 --> 00:09:13.033
Inkay!

164
00:09:13.100 --> 00:09:15.900
- Nuzzle, 'kay?
- Denne! Ne!

165
00:09:15.966 --> 00:09:19.000
Denne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne-ne!

166
00:09:19.066 --> 00:09:21.533
- Denne!
- Gour...

167
00:09:21.600 --> 00:09:24.200
- Shadow Ball, now!
- Geist!

168
00:09:24.266 --> 00:09:25.300
Denne!

169
00:09:25.366 --> 00:09:27.366
- Oh! Dedenne!
- Huh? Tyrunt!

170
00:09:27.433 --> 00:09:30.300
-Let's go, Tyrunt!

171
00:09:30.366 --> 00:09:32.033
-Bunn, bunn!

172
00:09:32.100 --> 00:09:35.000
- The nerve. Get back here!
- Such bad manners.

173
00:09:35.066 --> 00:09:36.266
Stop!

174
00:09:36.333 --> 00:09:38.966
Bunnelby! Use Dig!

175
00:09:39.033 --> 00:09:41.000
Bunn...

176
00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:46.200
Come on!

177
00:09:46.933 --> 00:09:49.800
-Escaped again.

178
00:09:51.666 --> 00:09:54.600
Noibat. Noi.

179
00:09:58.766 --> 00:10:01.433
- Talonflame!
- Talonflame.

180
00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:04.000
- See anything?
- Talon.

181
00:10:04.066 --> 00:10:06.266
- What about you?
- Noibat.

182
00:10:06.333 --> 00:10:09.600
Please look again! This time, expand your search area!

183
00:10:09.666 --> 00:10:12.200
- We're counting on you two!
- Noibat!

184
00:10:13.066 --> 00:10:14.600
Bonnie...

185
00:10:15.966 --> 00:10:17.833
Let's play a trick on Team Rocket.

186
00:10:17.900 --> 00:10:22.300
Bunnelby, dig a bunch of holes just like when we were playing before!

187
00:10:22.366 --> 00:10:24.233
By! Bunnelby!

188
00:10:24.300 --> 00:10:28.233
By! By! By! By!

189
00:10:28.300 --> 00:10:31.366
- What?
- No way!

190
00:10:31.433 --> 00:10:33.266
- Resistance is futile!
- Yeah.

191
00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:35.633
When they come out of those holes, scoop them up!

192
00:10:35.700 --> 00:10:37.233
Ten-four!

193
00:10:37.300 --> 00:10:39.133
- There!
- Over there!

194
00:10:39.200 --> 00:10:40.833
- No.
- Over there!

195
00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.866
- Why, you...
- How dare you!

196
00:10:46.933 --> 00:10:48.100
Aah!

197
00:10:48.166 --> 00:10:49.933
- Over here!
- Over there!

198
00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:52.533
- That way!
- No, this way!

199
00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.666
Aaah!

200
00:10:55.733 --> 00:10:57.100
Bunnelby!

201
00:10:57.166 --> 00:11:00.633
Now's our chance to get out of here!

202
00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:03.666
- Get back here.
- Impudent brat!

203
00:11:03.733 --> 00:11:07.166
Hurry, hurry!

204
00:11:07.233 --> 00:11:10.266
-Hey, what's wrong, Tyrunt?

205
00:11:10.333 --> 00:11:12.633
- Are you tired?
- Tyrunt.

206
00:11:12.700 --> 00:11:16.166
- Ne! Denne-ne! Denne-ne!
- Bunn.

207
00:11:17.900 --> 00:11:22.166
Ah! Here. Have some water.

208
00:11:22.233 --> 00:11:24.066
-Rar! Tyrunt!

209
00:11:24.133 --> 00:11:27.466
- By! Bunn, bunn,
- Me too.

210
00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:30.966
- Aah!
- Hm. That's good!

211
00:11:31.033 --> 00:11:32.966
- Tyrunt, your fur is a little messy.
- Ty?

212
00:11:33.033 --> 00:11:34.033
Here.

213
00:11:36.600 --> 00:11:39.066
-Like it? It feels good, right?

214
00:11:39.133 --> 00:11:41.266
Tyrunt.

215
00:11:41.333 --> 00:11:43.600
- Inkay! Inkay!
- Aah!

216
00:11:44.533 --> 00:11:49.033
- Hi!
- Those guys just won't give up.

217
00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:52.266
- Hurry, hurry!
- Tyrunt!

218
00:11:52.333 --> 00:11:55.300
- Get back here!
- This way!

219
00:11:55.366 --> 00:11:56.766
Bunn, bunn, bunn, bunn.

220
00:11:56.833 --> 00:11:58.400
Give it up!

221
00:11:58.466 --> 00:12:02.133
Unh! That twerpette is way too quick for her own good!

222
00:12:05.166 --> 00:12:07.166
-Come on, you can do it.

223
00:12:09.533 --> 00:12:11.533
Ty!

224
00:12:11.600 --> 00:12:13.566
Aah!

225
00:12:13.633 --> 00:12:15.000
Tyrunt!

226
00:12:18.133 --> 00:12:21.466
- Tyrunt.
- That was a close call.

227
00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:23.600
Tyrunt.

228
00:12:23.666 --> 00:12:26.666
Yeah. We made it. You climbed up really well.

229
00:12:26.733 --> 00:12:29.266
We should all be safe up here.

230
00:12:30.733 --> 00:12:33.133
Your little legs can only carry you so far.

231
00:12:33.200 --> 00:12:37.366
- Now hand over our Tyrunt!
- Tyrunt's gonna travel with me! Got it?

232
00:12:37.433 --> 00:12:39.233
Stay back, OK?

233
00:12:39.300 --> 00:12:41.066
- Denne-ne!
- Bunnelby!

234
00:12:41.133 --> 00:12:43.533
- OK, Inkay, go!
- Inkay!

235
00:12:43.600 --> 00:12:44.933
- Use Tackle!
- Ink!

236
00:12:45.000 --> 00:12:46.566
- Bunnelby!
- By!

237
00:12:46.633 --> 00:12:48.066
- Bunnelby!
- Inkay!

238
00:12:48.133 --> 00:12:49.233
All right!

239
00:12:49.300 --> 00:12:51.866
Gourgeist, use Leech Seed!

240
00:12:51.933 --> 00:12:54.533
Go-go-go-go-go-go-go-gour!

241
00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.433
- Bunnelby!
- Use Seed Bomb!

242
00:12:57.500 --> 00:12:59.733
- Go-go-go-go-go-go-go-gour!
- Bunn!

243
00:12:59.800 --> 00:13:01.133
- Uh!
- Aah!

244
00:13:01.200 --> 00:13:03.133
Bunnelby.

245
00:13:03.200 --> 00:13:06.266
- Use Psybeam!
- Inkay!

246
00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:07.733
Denne-ne!

247
00:13:08.666 --> 00:13:10.233
Denne-ne...

248
00:13:10.300 --> 00:13:12.100
Dedenne! Be strong!

249
00:13:12.166 --> 00:13:15.700
- Let's go for the grab!
- And go for the nab!

250
00:13:17.433 --> 00:13:19.366
- Oh, no!
- Move it!

251
00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:21.666
Aah!

252
00:13:21.733 --> 00:13:23.933
- Tyrunt!
- Tyrunt!

253
00:13:25.866 --> 00:13:31.300
Stop it, now! Let go! Let go! Ah!

254
00:13:31.366 --> 00:13:34.466
-Say what? Get rid of that punky pest.

255
00:13:34.533 --> 00:13:36.833
Right away!

256
00:13:38.833 --> 00:13:40.333
What do you think you're doing?

257
00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:42.233
-Bunnelby!

258
00:13:44.700 --> 00:13:46.233
Tyrunt, runt, runt!

259
00:13:46.300 --> 00:13:49.166
You'll never sink your teeth into that super alloy!

260
00:14:00.400 --> 00:14:04.066
Tyrant!

261
00:14:04.300 --> 00:14:07.600
- Rant!
- Ah. Never say never!

262
00:14:13.900 --> 00:14:15.600
Tyrant!

263
00:14:19.600 --> 00:14:23.233
- Huh? Did you evolve?
- Tyrant!

264
00:14:23.300 --> 00:14:24.533
-Bunnelby!

265
00:14:24.600 --> 00:14:27.033
- Denne-ne!
- That's not part of my script.

266
00:14:29.600 --> 00:14:31.633
It evolved into Tyrantrum!

267
00:14:31.700 --> 00:14:33.033
Come on. Let's hurry!

268
00:14:33.100 --> 00:14:36.233
- Unh. Bonnie!
- Are you OK?

269
00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:38.000
Hi, Clemont!

270
00:14:38.066 --> 00:14:39.966
Ah! It's those twerps!

271
00:14:40.033 --> 00:14:44.333
- Wow. Bonnie, is that Tyrantrum?
- Yeah, it evolved!

272
00:14:44.400 --> 00:14:46.900
Tyrantrum. The Despot Pokémon.

273
00:14:46.966 --> 00:14:50.033
Using its jaw, Tyrantrum can rip through thick metal.

274
00:14:50.100 --> 00:14:52.333
In times past, it was considered unbeatable.

275
00:14:52.400 --> 00:14:54.966
- Awesome!
- Tyrantrum?

276
00:14:55.033 --> 00:14:57.833
- Thank you for protecting Bonnie!
- Rant.

277
00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:59.800
How dare you ruin our plan?

278
00:14:59.866 --> 00:15:02.200
It's payback time and you're going to pay!

279
00:15:02.266 --> 00:15:04.600
With your Pokémon!

280
00:15:04.666 --> 00:15:06.333
-Pika!

281
00:15:06.400 --> 00:15:07.800
You're not going anywhere.

282
00:15:07.866 --> 00:15:10.000
- Stand still and save time.
- Pika, pika!

283
00:15:10.066 --> 00:15:13.166
Tyrantrum, please help my brother and my friends!

284
00:15:13.233 --> 00:15:14.966
- Huh?
- Rantrum!

285
00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:17.700
-Check it out!

286
00:15:17.766 --> 00:15:19.966
- Pika!
- It bit through it like it was nothing!

287
00:15:20.033 --> 00:15:22.133
You go, Tyrantrum!

288
00:15:25.433 --> 00:15:27.033
Ran!

289
00:15:29.100 --> 00:15:32.533
Come on! Tyrantrum was ours long before the twerps!

290
00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:35.066
I guess you could say Operation Take Tyrunt

291
00:15:35.133 --> 00:15:38.366
turned out to be a whole lot more take than we could chew.

292
00:15:38.433 --> 00:15:41.633
From now on, let's go after something with a bit less lip.

293
00:15:41.700 --> 00:15:43.533
I hate twerps!

294
00:15:43.600 --> 00:15:46.033
We're blasting off again!

295
00:15:46.100 --> 00:15:47.900
Inkay!

296
00:15:49.600 --> 00:15:51.966
Wow, I had no idea you were so strong!

297
00:15:52.033 --> 00:15:54.300
Ty!

298
00:15:54.366 --> 00:15:55.966
-Denne! Denne!

299
00:15:56.033 --> 00:15:58.366
Denne-ne! Denne!

300
00:15:58.433 --> 00:15:59.966
Denne-ne!

301
00:16:00.100 --> 00:16:02.300
- Ran!
- So cute! Can we keep it?

302
00:16:02.366 --> 00:16:03.533
Please, Clemont, please?

303
00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.566
- Bonnie!
- Why not?

304
00:16:05.633 --> 00:16:09.633
- Look at how close the two of them are.
- The more the merrier.

305
00:16:09.700 --> 00:16:10.733
Pika, pika!

306
00:16:10.800 --> 00:16:13.333
Don't forget, you're taking care of Tyrantrum!

307
00:16:13.400 --> 00:16:16.200
I will! I'll do everything.

308
00:16:16.266 --> 00:16:19.333
Tyrantrum, you'll always be with me!

309
00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:22.233
All right, then. Promise to take care of it!

310
00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.100
Huh? What happened?

311
00:16:25.166 --> 00:16:28.800
- Huh?
- What's wrong? Is it broken?

312
00:16:28.866 --> 00:16:30.333
- No.
- Huh?

313
00:16:30.400 --> 00:16:34.400
I'm afraid, no, Tyrantrum already has a trainer.

314
00:16:34.466 --> 00:16:36.333
Uh? Huh?

315
00:16:39.233 --> 00:16:41.166
Tyrantrum!

316
00:16:42.766 --> 00:16:45.800
- A-ha. So there you are!
- Who are you?

317
00:16:45.866 --> 00:16:49.866
You see, we're both scientists from the Pokémon Fossil Research Lab.

318
00:16:49.933 --> 00:16:52.200
Pokémon Fossil Research Lab?

319
00:16:52.266 --> 00:16:56.700
Uh? Uh? Oh!

320
00:16:56.766 --> 00:17:00.266
Of course. I thought it was strange to see a wild Tyrunt.

321
00:17:00.333 --> 00:17:03.566
That means you're the research lab's Pokémon?

322
00:17:03.633 --> 00:17:05.833
Tyrantrum.

323
00:17:07.266 --> 00:17:09.433
I see. So that's what happened.

324
00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.366
You took it upon yourself to take care of Tyrantrum.

325
00:17:12.433 --> 00:17:16.066
She did. Bonnie is the one who did everything.

326
00:17:16.133 --> 00:17:18.566
Thank you so much, Bonnie.

327
00:17:18.633 --> 00:17:22.433
Let us give you a tour of the Pokémon Fossil Research Lab as our thanks.

328
00:17:22.500 --> 00:17:25.300
Yeah? That sounds like a lot of fun!

329
00:17:25.366 --> 00:17:29.433
- Pika, pika.
- I bet there'll be lots of Pokémon!

330
00:17:29.500 --> 00:17:34.866
Hey, Bonnie? Let's all go to the Research Lab.

331
00:17:36.000 --> 00:17:37.200
OK?

332
00:17:43.966 --> 00:17:47.366
- Whoa! It's huge!
- Pikachu.

333
00:17:47.433 --> 00:17:50.500
Yeah! So this is where you restore Fossils into Pokémon?

334
00:17:50.566 --> 00:17:52.866
- Yes, that's correct.
- Incredible!

335
00:17:52.933 --> 00:17:56.366
- Don't you think so, Bonnie?
- Hm.

336
00:18:02.533 --> 00:18:05.266
- Aerodactyl! Whoa!
- Pika, pika!

337
00:18:05.333 --> 00:18:08.566
Oh. Wow. What a wonderful opportunity!

338
00:18:08.633 --> 00:18:11.033
- Isn't it great to see them?
- Hm!

339
00:18:11.100 --> 00:18:14.666
Huh? Bonnie, look at that! It's a Kabuto!

340
00:18:14.733 --> 00:18:16.366
Ha-ha.

341
00:18:16.433 --> 00:18:18.100
I can't believe they're all real.

342
00:18:18.166 --> 00:18:21.933
- Incredible stuff!
- Check it out! You'll love what you see.

343
00:18:22.000 --> 00:18:24.400
Pikachu.

344
00:18:24.466 --> 00:18:28.400
And this area here is where all our Tyrunt and Tyrantrum live.

345
00:18:28.466 --> 00:18:30.266
So they're all Tyrantrum's friends?

346
00:18:30.333 --> 00:18:34.400
Right. They're all so close, they're like family.

347
00:18:39.933 --> 00:18:41.033
Huh?

348
00:18:41.100 --> 00:18:43.866
Now, Bonnie, I think its time to say goodbye.

349
00:18:45.066 --> 00:18:46.300
Hey, Bonnie?

350
00:18:58.133 --> 00:18:59.966
- Pika! Pika!
- Denne!

351
00:19:00.100 --> 00:19:01.933
Raaar! Ah, ah, ah!

352
00:19:02.000 --> 00:19:03.133
Ty!

353
00:19:03.200 --> 00:19:06.666
- Brushing your teeth's good for you.
- Tyrunt!

354
00:19:06.733 --> 00:19:08.533
Feel good? I'm glad.

355
00:19:11.633 --> 00:19:14.100
-Huh?

356
00:19:22.100 --> 00:19:25.766
Now that you're a Tyrantrum, you're way too big to act like a baby.

357
00:19:25.833 --> 00:19:29.733
- It's time to be a grown-up.
- Tyrantrum.

358
00:19:29.800 --> 00:19:33.933
Don't cause any trouble for the scientists, OK?

359
00:19:35.033 --> 00:19:39.500
Tyrantrum really likes to be brushed, so I think I should give this to you.

360
00:19:39.566 --> 00:19:42.900
Thank you, Bonnie. We'll be sure to use it all the time.

361
00:19:42.966 --> 00:19:46.200
Bye-bye. Take care, Tyrantrum.

362
00:19:48.033 --> 00:19:51.366
No, no! You belong here at the lab!

363
00:19:51.433 --> 00:19:53.066
Don't follow me!

364
00:19:54.266 --> 00:19:56.966
-Tyran.

365
00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:00.966
Oh, Bonnie.

366
00:20:01.033 --> 00:20:03.466
I know. Don't worry. I know.

367
00:20:07.766 --> 00:20:09.600
Bye-bye, now.

368
00:20:11.100 --> 00:20:12.966
I won't forget you.

369
00:20:13.033 --> 00:20:15.900
Tyran.

370
00:20:16.866 --> 00:20:20.400
In the world of Pokémon, there are hellos in life,

371
00:20:20.466 --> 00:20:22.200
and there are goodbyes as well.

372
00:20:22.266 --> 00:20:25.866
And so, with fond memories of Tyrunt and Tyrantrum

373
00:20:25.933 --> 00:20:28.100
etched into Bonnie's heart forever,

374
00:20:28.166 --> 00:20:32.500
our heroes bid a fond farewell to the Pokémon Fossil Research Lab,

375
00:20:32.566 --> 00:20:34.700
as their journey continues!

376
00:20:37.066 --> 00:20:41.766
Take care, Tyrantrum. I'll come and see you again someday.

377
00:20:41.833 --> 00:20:44.900
Rantrum.
